A bag contains $12$ red counters and $4$ blue counters. One counter is chosen at random. Mark the probability of choosing red on this scale.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=8cm,every node/.style={font=\small}]
\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (1,0);
\foreach \x in {0,0.25,0.5,0.75,1} {\draw (\x,-0.06) -- (\x,0.06);}
\node[below] at (0,-0.06) {$0$};
\node[below] at (0.5,-0.06) {$\frac{1}{2}$};
\node[below] at (1,-0.06) {$1$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
